From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*surdak||to die}} (compare {{cog|et|surema||to die}}), from {{inh|fi|urj-pro|*śure-||to die}}. The modern meaning is by contamination from {{m|fi|surku}}; the original meaning is still found in the derivative {{m|fi|surma||killing}}. May also be related to {{cog|myv|сырьмай||death}}.

